id: pm-jira-sdk-host-alignment-1122
title: Adopt pm-cli 2026.11.23 host-aligned SDK behaviour
description: "Bring the pinned Jira toolchain onto the current SDK and verify native host behaviour. Companion item: pm-cli-website-spus."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
