acceptance_criteria: "Pin the current toolchain, classify full-suite failures against the installed SDK, preserve validation and import semantics, pass the repository gates at existing thresholds, and regenerate the changelog."
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-23T19:39:14.959Z",codex-agent,"The full suite with the bumped toolchain found one failure, “every command option: absent / empty / spaces / tab / CRLF / valid, with zero HTTP on blanks” (320/321). The old harness accepted the fixture's shared project option on unrelated commands. The current host rejects undeclared options before dispatch with unknown_option (exit 2). Seed only options declared for each command and assert that jira validate still refuses project before HTTP. The matrix retains 570 cases, including 380 blanks and zero HTTP calls for those blanks. Reverting the matrix change reproduces the failure. The bounded pm-github caller pin passes on current main. The atomic importer already commits its complete create rows in the transaction.\n\nFull-depth npm and Bun release checks each passed 321/321 with zero failures, skips, or cancellations. Coverage is 100% lines, branches, and functions across 10 sources. Typecheck, test compilation, docstrings (21 files, 108 declarations), the 10-comparison SDK differential, strict tracker health, production audit, pack dry run, and release contract checks passed. The linked PM test passed 3/3 in an isolated tracker copy. No upstream SDK bug was reproduced. Branch checks will appear at https://github.com/unbraind/pm-jira/actions?query=branch%3Adeps%2Fadopt-pm-cli-host-alignment-1122."
